From: postmarketOS <bramble@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: link msm_fbdev into the msm_drm module

msm_drm is built as a module on redbull, but msm_fbdev.o was added as a
separate obj-y target. Its symbols are not exported, so modpost fails
with "msm_fbdev_init undefined" when CONFIG_DRM_FBDEV_EMULATION is set.
Link the object into msm_drm.ko instead.

--- a/techpack/display/msm/Makefile
+++ b/techpack/display/msm/Makefile
@@ -128,6 +128,6 @@
 	msm_prop.o \
 	msm_notifier.o\
 
-obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_MSM)	+= msm_drm.o
+msm_drm-$(CONFIG_DRM_FBDEV_EMULATION) += msm_fbdev.o
 
-obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_FBDEV_EMULATION) += msm_fbdev.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_MSM)	+= msm_drm.o
